'''Cammy''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Street Fighter Collaboration Event/Red Team Gacha Drop|Street Fighter Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 14.7 Update|Version 14.7]] for [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]] and [[Version 15.0 Update|Version 15.0]] for [[The Battle Cats|BCEN]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 826
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Cammy
|name2 = Cammy CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Cammy CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Cammy's stats and abilities are essentially the same as [[Mighty Aethur Ltd. (Uber Rare Cat)|Atlantis Logistix]]'s abilities, but for Aliens instead. Her cheap cost and [[Insane Damage]] ability serve as a good unit to dispose Aliens inside of cash-tight stages, while dealing up to ''91,800'' (147,000 at Lv.50) damage against them.

However, while she has great offense, her subpar survivability and low range of 375 prevents her from being effective against most Alien backliners such as [[Calamary]], [[Alpacky]] and [[Elder Sloth]]. Luckily, her [[Dodge Attack|Dodge]] ability does help her staying on the field for a bit longer to help Cammy dispose these Alien threats as long as she possibly can before being eventually taken down.

{{Job|Classification = Nuker}}

