==Trivia==
*Cammy first became obtainable alongside [[Juri (Uber Rare Cat)|Juri]] in [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]] on October 3rd, 2025.
**In [[The Battle Cats|BCEN]], they were first made obtainable on January 9th, 2026.
*For her attack, Cammy performs Cannon Spike, a foot first Shoryuken-style move.
*Cammy and Juri both share the unusual trait of having icons that use their enemy variants' designs, rather than mirrored versions of their own, as is standard for most units.

